| HTTP Method | Route              | Description                                            | Role Required | Request Body                                                     | Expected Response                                                                                     |
| ----------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET         | `/api/events`      | Retrieves all upcoming events.                         | None          | None                                                             | **200 OK** containing event list.                                                                     |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}` | Retrieves detailed information about a specific event. | None          | None                                                             | **200 OK** with event; **404 Not Found** if event does not exist.                                     |
| POST        | `/api/events`      | Creates a new RaceDay event.                           | Organiser     | EventName, Description, EventDate, Location, Distance, EventType | **201 Created** with event; **400 Bad Request** for invalid data; **403 Forbidden** for Participants. |
| PUT         | `/api/events/{id}` | Updates an existing event.                             | Organiser     | EventName, Description, EventDate, Location, Distance, EventType | **200 OK** with updated event; **404 Not Found** if unavailable; **403 Forbidden** if incorrect role. |
| DELETE      | `/api/events/{id}` | Deletes an event created by the Organiser.             | Organiser     | None                                                             | **204 No Content**; **404 Not Found** if event does not exist; **403 Forbidden** if not authorised.   |
